e same thing)\n6. Recently-added code that doesn't yet pay rent\n\nIf you find genuinely nothing meaningful (the codebase is converged), say so clearly with evidence — e.g. \"checked X, Y, Z — all deep, all tested, no parallel switches, no shallow wrappers\".\n\nReport as numbered candidates ranked by friction severity. Under 800 words. Don't propose interfaces — just identify the smell."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5372,"cache_read_input_tokens":37424,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5372},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2b9bb146-1d8c-4ac2-bc65-549f8194c6ce","uuid":"8bf5f948-77ee-46f5-b6b0-c65c512477c7","request_id":"req_011CbSiMDhepBHz3mYfUMyHW"}
